  {
   "id": "a-castle-full-of-cats-210901@major-2024-06-12",
   "gameId": "a-castle-full-of-cats-210901",
   "displayName": "Final Update is Here!",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2024-06-12T16:59:01.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello, hoomans!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "It's here! ːcathspawː Enjoy the release of the final update for A Castle Full of Cats! This bonus stage brings a fitting close to this chapter of A Castle Full of Cats.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Enter the Castle one last time for a purrfect ending to this meowgical adventure. 💜",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We also added four new achievments to the game, 2 for this update and 2 for the last one.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Thank you for all your love and support throughout this journey. We really appreciate it! ːlovecatː",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "If you enjoyed A Castle Full of Cats, you'll love A Tower Full of Cats, released just a few weeks ago. It follows the same system of finding cats and items, but on a much grander adventure. ːfofinoː",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "And finally, we have a special gift for you: Stray Cats in Cozy Town, a free hidden object game coming soon! ːfofino2ː",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Stay tuned for more exciting news and adventures!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Love and purrs,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The Devcats ฅ^•⩊•^ฅ",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
