  {
   "id": "a-castle-full-of-cats-210901@major-2024-04-24",
   "gameId": "a-castle-full-of-cats-210901",
   "displayName": "Final Update is Coming!",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2024-04-24T16:33:40.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello hoomans!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We want to thank you all for the love our latest update has received! We're purring with joy at your comments and warm reception! ːstareyescatː",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "This has made us believe it's time to tease another upcoming update for A Castle Full of Cats, one that will bring the game to its final version, completing this part of Lily's and Fofiño's saga.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "So get ready for the purrfect finale! ːfofinoː We won't reveal much right meow, but we're adding something our community has been asking for since the game's release!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We'd also like to disclose that, with so many new features added since the game's release, we've had to make a decision about pricing. After 1st of May, A Castle Full of Cats will cost $3.99. This change won't affect anyone who already owns the game or those who purchase it before the price adjustment. And, of course, everyone who owns the game by the time the update rolls out will be able to play it without additional cost. ːkleinesː",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Love and purrs,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The Devcats",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
