  {
   "id": "a-castle-full-of-cats-210901@major-2022-11-17",
   "gameId": "a-castle-full-of-cats-210901",
   "displayName": "Quality of Life Update",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2022-11-17T21:27:18.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello, humans!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "A Castle Full of Cats launched a week ago and we are very happy with the results so far! ːfofino2ː",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We have been working all the week long on solving small problems and making quality of life changes suggested by you.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Patch notes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Changed the \"back\" navigation arrows",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The zoom now follows the cursor",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed the mouse lag",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "fixed",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "It's now possible to click and drag on a door without entering it",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Tweaked some things on Fofiño's fight to make it more forgiving",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Removed the most difficult cats from Fofiño's fight",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The hint system now zooms in",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Hint particles last longer now",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Almost all rooms were optimized",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Changed the way the game renders some bigger maps",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed some size limits for making the game working on older GPUs",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "New SFX for Fofiño's door",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "New SFX for the kittens",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed Catchulhu's sign showing the text always in English",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "It's now possible to exit the map by clicking out the map",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "New coordinate/zoom when entering some rooms",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Changed the Credits tab",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed some typos",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed achievements not triggering when playing offline",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "A lot of minor changes that we forgot already ^^",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Now on to what really matters!!!",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Yesterday was Fofiño's birthday!!!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
